","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/01/6131962/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんたーん♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回の記事のふぁみたんからの\nコメントを読んでいたら『ぷっ。』\nって1人なのに吹いてしまいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"23:18にご飯食べよw"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って書いたら皆さんから\nこんな時間に食べたら太るよ‼\nってコメントがたくさん♡わー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんあたしは案の定\nご飯を食べましたw"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして昨日\n撮影していました( •ㅈ• )やった\n自然光で撮ったので仕上がりが\n物凄く楽しみです♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これぐらいしか\n書けない(´;ω;`)\n早く皆さんに色々伝えたいのにー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んーー楽しみに待っていてくださいw"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きおとりなおしてQ&A( •ㅈ• )えへ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.全部コメント読んでる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.はい勿論( •ㅈ• )\n皆さんからのコメントは\n嬉しいんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.まだ1人暮らしで料理して\nないの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.んーこの質問はーー(´;ω;`)\nしてない！の一言に限るw"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.咳が止まんないとき\nどうすればいい？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.んー咳の辛さは凄く分かる(´;ω;`)\n寝れなくなるんだよね。んー\n飴なめても止まらないかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.学園祭とかって行ける\nもんなの？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.たぶんチケットがあれば\n誰でも入れます♡\n皆で楽しみましょう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.香水使ってたらどうゆうのか\n教えて( •ㅈ• )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.あたし香水使ってないんです(´;ω;`)\nごめんなさい。どちらかというと\n柔軟剤派なんです♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.ふぁみたんカラーは何色？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.あたしはピンクが好きなので\nテーマカラーはピンクがいいかな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.ゆったんが来てるニット\nどこのー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.今回のもsnidelです( •ㅈ• )\n他にも可愛いのいっぱいあるから\nお店見て見てね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.相談事があります、相談\nのってくれますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.はい、対したこと言えないかも\nしれませんが全然聞き役に\nなりますよ(´;ω;`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それではまたQ&A開きたい\nと思います( •ㅈ• )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/01/6131962/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"通信中。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たんたんたん ゆったんたん( •ㅈ• )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"_"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-1321":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"どもっ（。・_・。)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/09/image0072.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"川後であります( *・ω・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただいま福岡です(・∀・)イェイ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしたは、ソラリアにてイベントです(´・ω・｀)♪"},{"type":"break"},{